# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxcursor
pkgver=1.2.3
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 cursor management library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxrender libxfixes)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libXcursor-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('fde9402dd4cfe79da71e2d96bb980afc5e6ff4f8a7d74c159e1966afb2b2c2c0')

build() {
    cd libXcursor-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd libXcursor-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
